Alternatively, maybe I can think in feet. If each piece is 6 inches, that is 0.5 feet. So, 4 feet divided by 0.5 feet per piece. Dividing by 0.5 is the same as multiplying by 2, so 4 times 2 is 8. Same answer. So that confirms it. So either way, whether converting to inches or thinking in feet, the answer is 8.

