Calculating the food for the remaining 185 days:
$$ 185 \text{ days} \times 2 \text{ cups/day} = 370 \text{ cups} $$

Total dog food required for the year:
$$ 180 \text{ cups} + 370 \text{ cups} = 550 \text{ cups} $$

Each bag contains 110 cups, so the number of bags needed is:
$$ \frac{550 \text{ cups}}{110 \text{ cups/bag}} = 5 \text{ bags} $$

