$$
\text{Total for children} = 5 \times 5 = 25 \text{ pounds}
$$

---

### Step 4: Add both totals

$$
\text{Total potato salad needed} = 200 + 25 = 225 \text{ pounds}
$$

---

### Final Answer

$$
\boxed{225}
$$

